[00:00.000] 作词 : Paul Simon
[00:00.000] 作曲 : Paul Simon

[00:01.900]Hello darkness my old friend
[00:07.570]l’ve come to talk with you again
[00:11.790]Because a vision softly creeping
[00:17.480]left its seeds while I was sleeping
[00:21.480]And the vision
[00:23.820]that was planted in my brain
[00:28.500]Still remains
[00:31.620]within the sound of silence
[00:37.950]In restless dreams I walked alone
[00:42.290]narrow streets of cobblestone
[00:47.300]Neath the halo of a street lamp
[00:51.880]I turned my collar to the cold and damp
[00:56.190]When my eyes were stabbed by the flash of a neon light
[01:02.790]That split the night and touched the sound of silence
[01:13.360]And in the naked light I saw
[01:17.460]ten thousand people maybe more
[01:21.650]People talking without speaking
[01:26.410]people hearing without listening
[01:31.030]People writing songs
[01:35.100]that voices never share
[01:39.850]No one dare disturb the sound of silence
[01:48.950]Fools said I you do not know silence like a cancer grows
[01:58.280]Hear my words that I might teach you
[02:03.040]take my arms that I might reach you
[02:06.990]But my words like silent raindrops fell
[02:13.580]And echoed in the wells of silence
[02:25.680]And the people bowed and prayed to the neon god they made
[02:34.920]And the sign flashed out its warning
[02:39.950]in the words that it was forming
[02:44.440]And the sign said the words of the prophets are written on the subway walls
[02:52.140]And tenement halls
[02:54.600]and whispered in the sounds of silence

[00:01.900]你好 黑暗 我的老朋友
[00:07.570]我又来和你交谈
[00:11.790]因为有一种幻觉正向悄悄地向我袭来
[00:17.480]在我熟睡的时候留下了它的种子
[00:21.480]这种幻觉
[00:23.820]在我的脑海里生根发芽
[00:28.500]缠绕着我
[00:31.620]伴随着寂静的声音
[00:37.950]在不安的梦幻中我独自行走
[00:42.290]狭窄的鹅卵石街道
[00:47.300]在路灯的光环照耀下
[00:51.880]我竖起衣领 抵御严寒和潮湿
[00:56.190]一道耀眼的霓虹灯光 刺入我的眼睛
[01:02.790]它划破夜空 触摸着寂静的声音
[01:13.360]在炫目的灯光下
[01:17.460]我看见成千上万的人
[01:21.650]人们说而不言
[01:26.410]听而不闻
[01:31.030]人们创造歌曲却唱不出声来
[01:35.100]没有人敢
[01:39.850]打扰这寂静的声音
[01:48.950]我说：傻瓜，难道你不知道 寂静如同顽疾滋长
[01:58.280]听我对你说的有益的话
[02:03.040]拉住我伸给你的手
[02:06.990]但是我的话犹如雨滴飘落
[02:13.580]在寂静的水井中回响
[02:25.680]人们向自己创造的霓虹之神 神光中闪射出告诫的语句
[02:34.920]在字里行间指明
[02:39.950]它告诉人们
[02:44.440]预言者的话都已写在 地铁的墙上
[02:52.140]和房屋的大厅里
[02:54.600]在寂静的声音里低语